sequenceDiagram
    participant KFP as KFP Component Pod<br/>(pipelines-components wrapper)
    participant AI4RAG as ai4rag library<br/>(in-process)
    participant S3 as S3-compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MaaS as MaaS / OpenAI-compatible<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VS as Vector Store<br/>Milvus 19530 / pgvector 5432 / Neo4j 7687
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over KFP,HF: Flow 2: Connected-mode extraction model preparation (optional)
    KFP->>AI4RAG: prepare_extraction()
    AI4RAG->>HF: Download pinned RapidOCR / Whisper models<br/>TLS, no auth (revision-pinned)
    HF-->>AI4RAG: Model artifacts
    Note right of HF: Skipped with HF_HUB_OFFLINE / disconnected mode<br/>(uses DOCLING_ARTIFACTS_PATH, HF_MODEL_DIR)

    Note over KFP,HF: Flow 1: AutoRAG optimization run
    KFP->>AI4RAG: Inject creds as env vars, call extract_text / AI4RAGExperiment
    AI4RAG->>S3: 1. List + GET documents / benchmark data<br/>TLS verified (AWS_CA_BUNDLE), AWS SigV4
    S3-->>AI4RAG: Documents
    AI4RAG->>MaaS: 2. GET /v1/models (model discovery)<br/>TLS verified, Bearer API key
    MaaS-->>AI4RAG: Model list

    loop Each HPO iteration (GAM or random)
        AI4RAG->>MaaS: 3. POST /v1/embeddings<br/>TLS verified, Bearer API key
        MaaS-->>AI4RAG: Embeddings
        AI4RAG->>VS: 4. Create ai4rag_* collection, index, hybrid search<br/>TLS (plaintext allowed for *.cluster.local)<br/>Token / username+password
        VS-->>AI4RAG: Retrieved chunks
        AI4RAG->>MaaS: 5. POST /v1/chat/completions (RAG template)<br/>TLS verified, Bearer API key
        MaaS-->>AI4RAG: Generated answers
        AI4RAG->>MaaS: 6. POST /v1/chat/completions (LLM judge / RAGAS)<br/>TLS verified, Bearer API key
        MaaS-->>AI4RAG: Evaluation scores
    end

    AI4RAG->>KFP: 7. KFPEventHandler (in-memory) / LocalEventHandler (local JSON)<br/>patterns, evaluation results, conversations
    KFP->>KFP: Emit pipeline artifacts
